  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advance Blight-resistant Potato Varieties</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity will engage in africa (Ethiopia and Nigeria) and Southeast Asia (Bangladesh and Indonesia) to advance blight-resistant potato varieties through the product life cycle. The activity will also improve the capacity of partner-country researchers and market systems to develop and disseminate biotechnology products that address food security challenges ultimately enhancing the productivity, resilience, and nutrition of smallholders.</narrative>
  </description>
